WEBVTT

00:01.500 --> 00:10.000
Though you exhausted every possible means, even personally arriving at North Territory Pass to rally the army's morale, in the end, exhausted state coffers and disparate national strength caused you to lose this battle.

00:11.480 --> 00:15.480
Not long after nandu City fell.

00:42.640 --> 00:44.040
You're still here.

00:44.840 --> 00:46.240
I've always been here.

00:49.960 --> 00:51.627
No matter what the outcome.

00:53.080 --> 00:55.747
I will face it together with Your Majesty.

00:58.960 --> 01:01.720
Great Xuan's accumulation over decades.

01:03.280 --> 01:04.947
Now destroyed in one fire.

01:06.040 --> 01:07.960
It is my fault.

01:10.640 --> 01:15.840
Since ancient times, rulers die with their state as long as I am here.

01:17.320 --> 01:19.320
Great Xuan will not be humiliated.

01:24.840 --> 01:26.840
Your Majesty still has a sword.

01:28.640 --> 01:30.040
Has heroic spirit.

01:30.840 --> 01:32.240
And me.

01:35.160 --> 01:36.827
They say Chen and Sikong.

01:37.520 --> 01:38.920
Rule the realm together.

01:39.960 --> 01:41.360
Now.

01:42.520 --> 01:44.187
It is Chen and Sikong.

01:45.640 --> 01:47.307
Facing survival and destruction together.

01:50.960 --> 01:52.360
Arm me.

01:53.840 --> 01:55.240
Yes.

01:55.760 --> 02:01.307
Miss Chen what a coincidence I am here on my granduncle's orders to report to His Majesty.

02:07.280 --> 02:11.560
Miss Chen my benefits aren't they a bit lacking?

02:11.640 --> 02:14.880
A mutually beneficial matter what else does Your Highness want?

02:14.960 --> 02:16.360
My friendship.

02:17.400 --> 02:19.733
Does Your Highness dare to want it?

02:23.080 --> 02:24.720
You traitor.

02:26.960 --> 02:30.187
Look at our ancestors think about what you've done.

02:31.520 --> 02:33.520
Do you still know your surname?

02:33.960 --> 02:35.360
Chen.

02:37.280 --> 02:41.680
This is for Your Highness for the Chen family and for the realm.

02:42.080 --> 02:43.480
The best outcome.

02:58.080 --> 02:59.480
Are you afraid?

03:00.400 --> 03:01.800
With Your Majesty here.

03:02.760 --> 03:04.160
I'm not afraid.

03:09.640 --> 03:13.520
Beat the drums for me I will protect Great Xuan.

03:14.200 --> 03:15.920
Until the end.

03:22.720 --> 03:25.640
Corpses fill the palace blood fills the streets.

03:26.080 --> 03:28.960
This is the integrity Xuan Kingdom lacked for decades.

03:29.720 --> 03:31.200
The capital's sun.

03:32.280 --> 03:33.680
Has set.

03:35.000 --> 03:50.000
Yet across the vast lands south of the Tianhe River, countless surviving loyalists of Great Xuan continued their unyielding resistance against the Wu Jun invasion.

